        <div class="step"><b>typing</b><span class="vi">phản hồi tức thì</span><span class="en">instant feedback</span></div>
        <div class="step"><b>enqueue</b><span class="vi">→ RQ worker</span><span class="en">→ RQ worker</span></div>
