| Secondary text | `--workspace-ink-muted` | `#667085` |
| Border | `--workspace-border` | `#D8DDE6` |
| Brand/focus | `--workspace-action`, `--workspace-focus` | `#1777FF` |
| Active text | `--workspace-teal-strong` | `#0267E8` |
